al palpatine  was said to have led such a group in  fact zazem and palpatine once  unsuccessfully tried to recruit boba  fett so again  this seems all too crazy to be a  coincidence but i want to hear you guys  weigh in on the latest developments of  chapter 12.  what do you think moff gideon is up to  and how does all this fit together  leave your comments below thanks for  watching everyone be sure to like  subscribe and share and for more bad  takes you can follow me on twitter and  instagram at think story yt  until next time remember i have spoken  you
 

